<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	   C/S =  5.11 %			C/S =  2.55 %</p>
<p>	   O/N =  2.55 %			O/N =  1.27 %</p>
<p>	   T/N =  2.55 %			T/N =  1.27 %</p>
<p>		   July 29, 1997		     July 28, 1997</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  2.38 %     1 month forward =  2.55 %</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  2.89 %     2 month forward =  2.72 %</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  3.18 %     3 month forward =  2.89 %</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  3.32 %     4 month forward =  3.18 %</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  3.54 %     5 month forward =  3.32 %</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  3.70 %     6 month forward =  3.54 %</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
